        <profile id="rangers-infiltrators-11e0" name="Infiltrators" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">When deploying, this unit can be set up more than 8" horizontally from enemy units and the enemy deployment zone.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile id="rangers-stealth-11e0" name="Stealth" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">If every model has Stealth, the unit receives the benefit of cover against ranged attacks.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile id="rangers-path-11e0" name="Path of the Outcast" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">In the opponent’s Movement phase, after an enemy finishes a move within 8", this unit may make a Normal move of up to D6" if not engaged.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile id="rangers-focus-11e0" name="Battle Focus (Faction)" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Aeldari faction ability. Consult the current 11e Battle Focus rules for tokens and Agile Manoeuvres; this test does not encode token management.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile id="rangers-keywords-profile-11e0" name="Rangers Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords">
